sequenceDiagram
    participant User as CLI / SDK
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS 1.2+ (rustls)
    participant OIDC as OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DB as SQLite / PostgreSQL<br/>local / 5432/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Supervisor as Sandbox Supervisor<br/>Unix Sockets
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Process<br/>UID 1000+
    participant OPA as OPA Policy Engine<br/>In-Process
    participant LLM as Upstream LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Sandbox Creation
        User->>Gateway: CreateSandbox (gRPC)<br/>Auth: OIDC JWT Bearer
        Gateway->>OIDC: JWKS Fetch<br/>TLS 1.2+
        OIDC-->>Gateway: JSON Web Key Set
        Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT + AuthZ<br/>(descriptor pool check)
        Gateway->>DB: Persist sandbox state<br/>SQL (TLS optional)
        Gateway->>K8sAPI: Create Pod + Sidecar<br/>SA Token Auth
        K8sAPI-->>Gateway: Pod created
        Gateway-->>User: Sandbox ready
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,Sandbox: Flow 2: Command Execution
        User->>Gateway: Exec (bidirectional stream)<br/>Auth: OIDC JWT Bearer
        Gateway->>Supervisor: ConnectSupervisor stream<br/>Auth: Sandbox JWT (mTLS)
        Supervisor->>Sandbox: Fork process<br/>Unix socket IPC<br/>Peer credential validation
        Sandbox-->>Supervisor: stdout/stderr
        Supervisor-->>Gateway: Stream response
        Gateway-->>User: Exec output
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Sandbox,LLM: Flow 3: Policy-Enforced Egress
        Sandbox->>Supervisor: HTTP CONNECT (intercepted)<br/>nftables redirect to proxy
        Supervisor->>Supervisor: Binary identity check<br/>(/proc/pid/exe)
        Supervisor->>OPA: Policy evaluation<br/>per-binary, per-host rules
        OPA-->>Supervisor: Allow/Deny + L7 rules
        alt Policy Allows
            Supervisor->>Supervisor: Inject provider credentials<br/>placeholder substitution
            Supervisor->>LLM: HTTPS request<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>Injected API key
            LLM-->>Supervisor: Response
            Supervisor-->>Sandbox: Proxied response
        else Policy Denies
            Supervisor-->>Sandbox: Connection refused
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Gateway,DB: Flow 4: Credential Refresh
        Gateway->>Gateway: Background refresh timer
        Gateway->>OIDC: OAuth token refresh<br/>TLS 1.2+
        OIDC-->>Gateway: New access token
        Gateway->>DB: Update credential state<br/>AES-256-GCM encrypted
    end
